me) monster while being stunned. Today my level 6 priest opened a
door; it was booby trapped; I was stunned and then attacked by a
panther. When I took a swipe at it I hit my rather meaty (for a level
6 priest) pet. I was then too scared to attempt to move for fear of
hurting my pet. Elbereth did not work (maybe stunned people don't
write very well) and prayer never seems to do anything when I'm
stunned. Inevitably, I get several turns of 'monster goes to attack,
pulls back, blah --more--' followed by 'you feel your god is pleased
with you' or some such, but it always leaves me still stunned and with
no healing at all. This is followed by death at the hands of whatever
monster has brought me to this state. (previous death from an ant
while stunned after eating a freshly dead bat)

What could I (potentially) have done. If it was a monster that I could
