was slow, I might find myself running away from it. I assume that
wands are not much use, since I tried out my unID'ed wand on the
panther, and although it turned out to be teleportation, the panther
did not go anywhere.

Almost all the deaths I have had have been educational, even the ant
death which happened in the gnomish mines (those gnomes die so easily,
why should it have a reputation for being hard??? I have finally
worked that out for myself :). But once I'm stunned it looks like a
crapshoot, and given how often I get stunned, I can't see how I could
ever get past Dlvl20 (my record so far is Dlvl13 in the gnomish mines)

any help gratefully received.

